# An intentionally empty module named like the MayaHydra module that Autodesk's MayaUSD
# installer registers (in "Autodesk Shared/Modules/maya/<version>/mayausd.mod").
#
# MayaHydra is built against Autodesk's own USD. When Maya finds a module of the same
# name on MAYA_MODULE_PATH it discards the installed one, so this keeps MayaHydra, and
# the Autodesk USD plugin path it adds, out of a session that runs this build against a
# different USD version. Without it, USD tries to load Autodesk's plugins into our USD.
+ MAYAHYDRA 0.0.0 ${CMAKE_INSTALL_PREFIX}
